[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12841.03, "timestamp": "03:34:01", "text": "我的 YouTuber 朋友，我们聊到这件事，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12843.91, "timestamp": "03:34:03", "text": "他们告诉我，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12847.67, "timestamp": "03:34:07", "text": "他们有一次去日本（"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12849.83, "timestamp": "03:34:09", "text": "不是去美国）"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12854.87, "timestamp": "03:34:14", "text": "，试着把生鸡蛋和米饭放在一起"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12857.75, "timestamp": "03:34:17", "text": "吃，结果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12859.67, "timestamp": "03:34:19", "text": "味道不好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12863.028, "timestamp": "03:34:23", "text": "。 味道太难吃了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12864.309, "timestamp": "03:34:24", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12866.95, "timestamp": "03:34:26", "text": "就像在日本一样，鸡蛋特别好吃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12869.59, "timestamp": "03:34:29", "text": "什么的。 可能跟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12871.11, "timestamp": "03:34:31", "text": "卫生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12872.95, "timestamp": "03:34:32", "text": "问题有关。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12876.95, "timestamp": "03:34:36", "text": "。 现在是晚上10点。 我的天哪，已经晚上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12883.349, "timestamp": "03:34:43", "text": "所以，这对你来说并不恶心。 我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12886.55, "timestamp": "03:34:46", "text": "吃生鸡蛋，那并不恶心。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12890.71, "timestamp": "03:34:50", "text": "想，我和我的室友确实会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12893.99, "timestamp": "03:34:53", "text": "吃生鸡蛋。 我们把它们放在米饭上，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12897.19, "timestamp": "03:34:57", "text": "然后从日本吃。 日本鸡蛋"}]